docs {
  # Get Crystal Band

  This endpoint retrieves a single crystal band by its minimum level.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": "1",
      "type": "crystalBands",
      "attributes": {
        "maxLevel": 40,
        "crystalItemId": 4260000,
        "count": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
